WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:06.211
"A car!" shouted Toad. "Of course!"

2
00:00:06.212 --> 00:00:09.726
He danced in circles.

3
00:00:09.727 --> 00:00:13.426
"I must have one! Vroom!

4
00:00:13.427 --> 00:00:19.630
Why have I waited so long?"

5
00:00:19.631 --> 00:00:23.423
"Help me," cried the bird in the cage.

6
00:00:23.424 --> 00:00:31.229
"You'll be all right," said Mole to the bird.

7
00:00:31.230 --> 00:00:35.900
"Let's set the cart right," said Mole.

8
00:00:35.901 --> 00:00:40.145
Rat and Mole tried to push the cart up.

9
00:00:40.146 --> 00:00:47.639
"One, two, three, push!" they said.

10
00:00:47.640 --> 00:00:52.435
The cart was too heavy.

11
00:00:52.436 --> 00:00:56.692
"One more try," said Mole.

12
00:00:56.693 --> 00:01:01.633
"Toad," said Rat, "please help with the cart."

13
00:01:01.634 --> 00:01:05.922
"It's just a silly yellow cart," said Toad.

14
00:01:05.923 --> 00:01:11.449
"Who cares? Soon I will have a car!"

15
00:01:11.450 --> 00:01:15.466
"What can we do with him?" asked Mole.

16
00:01:15.467 --> 00:01:17.817
"Nothing," said Rat.

17
00:01:17.818 --> 00:01:20.842
"He found a new interest.

18
00:01:20.843 --> 00:01:23.728
He'll be like this for days."

19
00:01:23.729 --> 00:01:30.691
"Vroom! Vroom!" shouted Toad.

20
00:01:30.692 --> 00:01:34.786
Rat and Mole decided to leave the cart.

21
00:01:34.787 --> 00:01:38.382
"The wheel is broken anyway," said Rat.

22
00:01:38.383 --> 00:01:42.139
"We'll walk to the next town," said Mole.

23
00:01:42.140 --> 00:01:47.143
Rat carried the birdcage and Mole led the horse.

24
00:01:47.144 --> 00:01:50.384
"Vroom!" said Toad.

25
00:01:50.385 --> 00:01:52.699
He ran to catch up.

26
00:01:52.700 --> 00:01:56.352
"Don't worry," he said cheerfully.

27
00:01:56.353 --> 00:01:59.801
"We'll find a stable for the horse.

28
00:01:59.802 --> 00:02:06.935
Then we'll take a train home. Zip zip!"

29
00:02:06.936 --> 00:02:11.382
The next day the riverbank was quiet.

30
00:02:11.383 --> 00:02:15.349
Rat and Mole sat fishing by the water.

31
00:02:15.350 --> 00:02:18.091
A rabbit ran up.

32
00:02:18.092 --> 00:02:21.435
"Did you hear the news?" she said.

33
00:02:21.436 --> 00:02:27.453
"Toad has bought a big fancy car!"

